    "pages": [
        {
            "id": "greeting",
            "speaker": "dexio",
            "lines": [
                {
                    "type": "expression",
                    "expression": "'Why hello, ' + q.player.username + '!';"
                }
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": [
                            "q.dialogue.set_page('page2');"
                        ]
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page2",
            "speaker": "dexio",
            "lines": [
                "How have you been?"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page3');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page3",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "How's your journey going? You see, when I was younger, I visited many different regions as well."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page4');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page4",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "I met many kinds of Pokémon and noticed how each place has its own distinct flavors."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page5');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page5",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "So, I really came to enjoy trying new foods as I traveled."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page6');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page6",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "Because of my adventures, I'm an expert on the cafés all over Kalos."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page7');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page7",
            "speaker": "dexio",
            "lines": [
                "Um... Professor..."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": [
                            "q.dialogue.set_page('page8');"
                        ]
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page8",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "Come now, Dexio. I'm going somewhere with this."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page9');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page9",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "Do you remember the Pokémon Lysandre mentioned in that café?"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page10');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page10",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "Kalos's Legendary Pokémon are called... Xerneas and Yveltal!"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page11');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page11",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "According to material I've read, those who saw them were so overwhelmed by their power,"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page12');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page12",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "they were only able to say that these Pokémon resembled the letters X and Y."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page13');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page13",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "Apparently, these Pokémon can control and absorb energy."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": [
                            "q.dialogue.set_page('page14');"
                        ]
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page14",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "Xerneas gives life energy to plants and Pokémon, and makes them full of vitality again."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": [
                            "q.dialogue.set_page('page15');"
                        ]
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page15",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "Yveltal's life span is said to be 1,000 years."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page16');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page16",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "When it reaches the end of its life, it steals all of the spirits around it."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page17');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page17",
            "speaker": "dexio",
            "lines": [
                "Wherever do you think Pokémon that amazing could be now?"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": [
                            "q.dialogue.set_page('page18');"
                        ]
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page18",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "When Kalos's Legendary Pokémon lose all of vitality, they go to sleep in a secret place."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page19');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page19",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "I don't have a clue where they could be."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page20');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page20",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "The writings that mention them are also around a thousand years old, so they aren't much help."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page21');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page21",
            "speaker": "dexio",
            "lines": [
                {
                    "type": "expression",
                    "expression": "'It would be absolutely astounding if you found them, ' + q.player.username + '.';"
                }
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page22');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page22",
            "speaker": "dexio",
            "lines": [
                "Maybe I'll look into the legend a little bit. If I find something, I'll let you know!"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page23');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page23",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "Ah ha ha! Oh, it would be a thrill if you found them, indeed!"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page24');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page24",
            "speaker": "sycamore",
            "lines": [
                "But your journey is yours and your Pokémon's alone. I want you to enjoy yourself and do whatever you'd like!"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": [
                            "q.run_command('particle cloud 645 108 -420 2 2 2 1 100');",
                            "q.run_command('particle cloud 645 108 -424 2 2 2 1 100');",
                            "q.run_command('tp @e[x=645,y=107,z=-424,dy=3,type=cobblemon:npc] 10000000 -50000 -10000000');",
                            "q.run_command('tp @e[x=645,y=107,z=-420,dy=3,type=cobblemon:npc] 10000000 -50000 -10000000');",
                            "q.dialogue.set_page('page25');"
                        ]
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page25",
            "speaker": "trevor",
            "lines": [
                "Um... Is the Professor gone already?"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": [
                            "q.run_command('particle cloud 642 108 -422 2 2 2 1 100');",
                            "q.dialogue.set_page('page26');"
                        ]
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page26",
            "speaker": "trevor",
            "lines": [
                "I was hoping to have him have a look at my Pokédex in person."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page27');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page27",
            "speaker": "trevor",
            "lines": [
                "Oh well, I can still get my Pokédex evaluated at a Pokémon Center's PC..."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page28');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page28",
            "speaker": "trevor",
            "lines": [
                "Anyway, I'm heading off to go look for Pokémon in the Frost Cavern and fill up more of my Pokédex!"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Close",
                        "value": "close",
                        "action": [
                            "q.run_command('particle cloud 642 108 -422 2 2 2 1 100');",
                            "q.run_command('tag ' + q.player.username + ' add Dialogue94');",
                            "q.run_command('tag ' + q.player.username + ' remove InDialogue');",
                            "q.dialogue.close();"
                        ]
                    }
                ]
            }
